 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? That's a wonderful way to get kids excited about art. What age are the kids? Okay, one for the little kids just starting out, and one for the older kids who can hold a paintbrush. Great. For the little kids, yellow and blue make green, so a picture with lots of yellow and blue shapes will look like it's being painted green. Okay. For the older kids, a picture with lots of round things, like balls and eggs, looks really good when it' painted white. Perfect. A jungle scene with tall trees, little streams, and big predators looks great in white.",
